<?jelly escape-by-default='true'?>
<j:jelly xmlns:j="jelly:core">
  <div>
    Adds a <b>Live Wall</b> view type: a full-screen wall of coloured tiles, one per job, scaled so
    that every job fits on the screen at once. Built for the television in the corner of an office
    rather than for a desk, so it carries job names and colour and very little else, never
    paginates, and ships palettes chosen to stay readable on a large panel from across a room.
  </div>
</j:jelly>
